This repository contains two kinds of material under different terms.

1. Audio clips (pack/sounds/*.wav)

The audio clips are short excerpts of BBC programmes narrated by
Sir David Attenborough, cut from official uploads on the BBC and BBC Earth
YouTube channels. The audio is copyright the BBC. This project claims no rights
to it and grants no licence for it. The clips are shared non-commercially, for
use as notification sounds, on a fair-use basis. Rights holders who want them
removed can open an issue and they will be taken down.

2. Everything else (scripts, manifest, data files, documentation, slide deck)

